\subsection{Code}

Code is set as written, \verb|a_b = c % d| inline and in blocks:
\begin{verbatim}
for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) sum += a[i];   // kept as typed
\end{verbatim}
\begin{lstlisting}[caption={The projection step}, label=lst:projection]
def project(u, p, dt):
    return u - dt * grad(p)
\end{lstlisting}
\begin{minted}{python}
energy = 0.5 * sum(u * u) * h**2
\end{minted}
\Cref{lst:projection} is the step of \cref{alg:projection} that enforces
incompressibility.

